    "title": "Partition Array into K Equal Sum Subsets",
    "category": "Recursion",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an integer array and an integer k, determine whether the array can be partitioned into k non-empty subsets having equal sums. Return true if possible; otherwise return false.",
